{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-heb-7-1","title":"Hebrews 7:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ Jesus is a priest after the order of Melchisedec; 11 and so far more excellent than the priests of Aaron's order.</p>\n<p>this. 6:20; Ge 14:18-20 Salem. Ps 76:2 the most. Ps 57:2; 78:35,56; Da 4:2; 5:18,21; Mic 6:6; Mr 5:7; Ac 16:17 the slaughter. Ge 16:14-16; Isa 41:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-2","title":"Hebrews 7:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>a tenth. Ge 28:22; Le 27:32; Nu 18:21; 1Sa 8:15,17 King of righteousness. 2Sa 8:15; 23:3; 1Ki 4:24,25; 1Ch 22:9; Ps 45:4-7; 72:1-3,7; 85:10,11 Isa 9:6,7; 32:1,2; 45:22-25; Jer 23:5,6; 33:15,16; Mic 5:5; Lu 2:14 Ro 3:26; 5:1,2; Eph 2:14-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-3","title":"Hebrews 7:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Without father.That is, as the Syriac renders, \"Whose father and mother are not inscribed among the genealogies; and therefore it was not known who he was.\"</p>\n<p>descent. Gr. pedigree. Ex 6:18,20-27; 1Ch 6:1-3 a priest. 17,23-28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-4","title":"Hebrews 7:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>the patriarch. Ac 2:29; 7:8,9 Abraham. Ge 12:2; 17:5,6; Ro 4:11-13,17,18; Ga 3:28,29; Jas 2:23 gave. Ge 14:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-5","title":"Hebrews 7:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>who. 5:4; Ex 28:1; Nu 16:10,11; 17:3-10; 18:7,21-26 to take. Le 27:30-33; Nu 18:26-32; 2Ch 31:4-6; Ne 13:10 come. 10; Ge 35:11; 46:26; Ex 1:5; 1Ki 8:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-6","title":"Hebrews 7:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>descent. Gr. pedigree. 3 received. 4; Ge 14:19,20 had. 6:13-15; 11:13,17; Ge 12:2,13; 13:14-17; 17:4-8; 22:17,18; Ac 3:25 Ro 4:13; 9:4; Ga 3:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-7","title":"Hebrews 7:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>without. 1Ti 3:16 the less. 11:20,21; Ge 27:20-40; 28:1-4; 47:7-10; 48:15-20; 49:28; Nu 6:23-27 De 32:1; 2Sa 6:20; 1Ki 8:55; 2Ch 30:27; Lu 24:50,51; 2Co 13:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-8","title":"Hebrews 7:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>men. 23; 9:27 he liveth. 3:16; 5:6; 6:20; 9:24,25; Joh 11:25,26; 14:6,19; Re 1:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-9","title":"Hebrews 7:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>payed. 4; Ge 14:20; Ro 5:12; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-10","title":"Hebrews 7:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>5; Ge 35:11; 46:26; 1Ki 8:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-11","title":"Hebrews 7:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>perfection.[Teleiosis ,] completion, or fulfilment of the plan and purpose of God.</p>\n<p>18,19; 8:7,10-13; 10:1-4; Ga 2:21; 4:3,9; Col 2:10-17 what. 26-28 another. 15,17,21; 5:6,10; 6:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-12","title":"Hebrews 7:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>a change. Isa 66:21; Jer 31:31-34; Eze 16:61; Ac 6:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-13","title":"Hebrews 7:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>of which. Nu 16:40; 17:5; 2Ch 26:16-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-14","title":"Hebrews 7:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Our Lord. Lu 1:43; Joh 20:13,28; Eph 1:3; Php 3:8 sprang. Ge 46:12; 49:10; Ru 4:18-22; Isa 11:1; Jer 23:5,6; Mic 5:2 Mt 1:3-16; Lu 2:23-33; 3:33; Ro 1:3; 2:3; Re 5:5; 22:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-15","title":"Hebrews 7:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>after. 3,11,17-21; Ps 110:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-16","title":"Hebrews 7:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>the law. 9:9,10; 10:1; Ga 4:3,9; Col 2:14,20 the power. 3,17,21,24,25,28; Re 1:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-17","title":"Hebrews 7:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>15,21; 5:6,10; 6:20; Ps 110:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-18","title":"Hebrews 7:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>a disannulling. 11,12; 8:7-13; 10:1-9; Ro 3:31; Ga 3:15,17 the weakness. 19; 8:7,8; 9:9,10; 10:1-4; 13:9; Ac 13:39; Ro 8:3; Ga 4:9,21; 1Ti 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-19","title":"Hebrews 7:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>the law. 11; 9:9; Ac 13:39; Ro 3:20,21; 8:3; Ga 2:16 made.[Ouden eteleiosen,] completed nothing; it was the introduction, but not the completion.</p>\n<p>the bringing in. or, it was the bringing in. Ga 3:24 a better. 6:18; 8:6; 11:40; Joh 1:17; Ro 8:3; Col 1:27; 1Ti 1:1 we. 4:16; 10:19-22; Ps 73:28; Joh 14:6; Ro 5:2; Eph 2:13-18; 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-21","title":"Hebrews 7:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>an oath. or, swearing of an oath. The Lord. 17; Ps 110:4 sware. 6:16-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-22","title":"Hebrews 7:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>a surety. Ge 43:9; 44:32; Pr 6:1; 20:16 of a. 8:6-12; 9:15-23; 12:24; 13:20; Da 9:27; Mt 26:28; Mr 14:24; Lu 22:20 1Co 11:25 testament.Rather covenant, [diatheke .]</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-23","title":"Hebrews 7:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>were. 8; 1Ch 6:3-14; Ne 12:10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-24","title":"Hebrews 7:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>But.[Ho de ,] But he, that is, Christ, because \"he continueth ever,\" hath [aparabatos hierosune ,] \"a priesthood that passeth not away from him.\"</p>\n<p>he continueth. 8-25,28; 13:8; Isa 9:6,7; Joh 12:34; Ro 6:9; Re 1:18 hath. 1Sa 2:35 an unchangeable priesthood. or, a priesthood which passethnot from one to another.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-25","title":"Hebrews 7:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>he is. 2:18; 5:7; Isa 45:22; 63:1; Da 3:15,17,29; 6:20; Joh 5:37-40; 10:29 Joh 10:30; Eph 3:20; Php 3:21; 2Ti 1:12; Jude 1:24 to the uttermost. or, evermore. come. 19; 11:6; Job 22:17; 23:3; Ps 68:31,32; Isa 45:24; Jer 3:22 by him. 13:15; Joh 14:6; Ro 5:2; Eph 2:18; 3:12; 1Jo 2:1,2 ever. 8,16,24 to make. 9:24; Isa 53:12; 59:16; Da 9:16; Joh 14:13,16; 16:23,24; 17:9-26 Ro 8:34; 1Ti 2:5; 1Jo 2:1,2; Re 8:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-26","title":"Hebrews 7:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>such. 11; 8:1; 9:23-26; 10:11-22 became. 2:10; Lu 24:26,46 holy. 4:15; 9:14; Ex 28:36; Isa 53:9; Lu 1:35; 23:22,41,47; Joh 8:29; 14:30 Ac 3:14; 4:27; 2Co 5:21; 1Pe 1:19; 2:22; 1Jo 2:2; 3:5; Re 3:7 made. 1:3; 4:14; 8:1; 12:2; Ps 68:18; Mt 27:18; Mr 16:19; Eph 1:20-22 Eph 4:8-10; Php 2:9-11; 1Pe 3:22; Re 1:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-27","title":"Hebrews 7:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>daily. 10:11; Ex 29:36-42; Nu 28:2-10 first. 5:3; 9:7; Le 4:3-35; 9:7-24; 16:6,11 and then. Le 4:13-16; 9:15; 16:15 this. 9:12,14,25,28; 10:6-12; Isa 53:10-12; Ro 6:10; Eph 2:22; Tit 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-7-28","title":"Hebrews 7:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>the law maketh. 5:1,2; Ex 32:21,22; Le 4:3 the word. 21; Ps 110:4 maketh the. 3; 1:2; 3:6; 4:14; 5:5,8 who. 21,24 consecrated. Gr. perfected. 2:10; 5:9; Lu 13:32; Joh 19:30; *Gr:</p>"}]}